{"branch":"Stable","buildingsData":{"Mining_Machine":{"className":"Mining_Machine","name":"Mining Machine","category":"extraction","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/mining-drill.png?v=1612259033","description":"The more veins covered by the mining machine, the faster the mining speed, and the same vein can be covered by multiple mining rings, but the more mining rings covered, the faster the consumption.","powerUsed":420,"idlePower":24,"extractionRate":45,"input":6,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Mining_Machine\/name\/Mining+Machine"},"Oil_Extractor":{"className":"Oil_Extractor","name":"Oil Extractor","category":"extraction","description":"When plasma is used to extract oil from the Crude oil seep, the extraction speed will be different for different Crude oil seep.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/oil-extractor.png?v=1612258406","powerUsed":840,"idlePower":24,"extractionRate":50,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Oil_Extractor\/name\/Oil+Extractor"},"Water_Pump":{"className":"Water_Pump","name":"Water Pump","category":"extraction","description":"Facility used to directly extract liquid resources from an ocean, including water and sulfuric acid.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/water-pump.png?v=1612259096","powerUsed":300,"idlePower":12,"extractionRate":75,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Water_Pump\/name\/Water+Pump"},"Orbital_Collector":{"className":"Orbital_Collector","name":"Orbital Collector","category":"extraction","description":"Used to collect the resources of gas giants, it needs to consume the collected fuel materials to maintain the energy required to work in orbit.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/orbital-collector.png?v=1612261199","powerUsed":30000,"extractionRate":30,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Orbital_Collector\/name\/Orbital+Collector"},"Smelter":{"className":"Smelter","name":"Smelter","category":"production","powerUsed":360,"idlePower":12,"image":"\/img\/gameUI\/smelter.png?v=1612258523","description":"High temperature arc smelting can smelt ores and metals. and also be used for purification and crystal smelting.","input":0,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Smelter\/name\/Smelter"},"Plane_Smelter":{"className":"Plane_Smelter","name":"Plane Smelter","category":"production","powerUsed":1440,"idlePower":48,"productionSpeed":2,"image":"\/img\/gameUI\/plane-smelter.png?v=1639126413","description":"When monopoles pass through the Plane Filter, they produce a quantum effect of self-organizing and can generate a thermodynamic negative temperature flow. Using this technology, the process of ores smelting or purification can be greatly accelerated.","input":0,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Plane_Smelter\/name\/Plane+Smelter"},"Assembling_Machine_Mk1":{"className":"Assembling_Machine_Mk1","name":"Assembling Machine Mk.I","category":"production","powerUsed":270,"idlePower":12,"productionSpeed":0.75,"image":"\/img\/gameUI\/assembler-1.png?v=1612259340","description":"The basic assembler. Can process iron and copper ingots into more advanced products.","input":0,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Assembling_Machine_Mk1\/name\/Assembling+Machine+Mk.I"},"Assembling_Machine_Mk2":{"className":"Assembling_Machine_Mk2","name":"Assembling Machine Mk.II","category":"production","powerUsed":540,"idlePower":18,"productionSpeed":1,"image":"\/img\/gameUI\/assembler-2.png?v=1612261219","description":"The production speed has been greatly improved, and items can be processed more quickly.","input":0,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Assembling_Machine_Mk2\/name\/Assembling+Machine+Mk.II"},"Assembling_Machine_Mk3":{"className":"Assembling_Machine_Mk3","name":"Assembling Machine Mk.III","category":"production","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/assembler-3.png?v=1612259069","description":"The production speed is maximized, and a reasonable combination of conveyor belts and sorters of different speeds can effectively avoid the empty assembler or product blockage.","powerUsed":780,"idlePower":18,"productionSpeed":1.5,"input":0,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Assembling_Machine_Mk3\/name\/Assembling+Machine+Mk.III"},"Chemical_Plant":{"className":"Chemical_Plant","name":"Chemical Plant","category":"production","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/chemical-plant.png?v=1612259283","description":"Chemical facility. Can process the primary products of Crude oil into more advanced chemical products.","powerUsed":720,"idlePower":24,"input":1,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Chemical_Plant\/name\/Chemical+Plant"},"Fractionator":{"className":"Fractionator","name":"Fractionator","category":"production","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/fractionator.png?v=1612258367","description":"Taking advantage of the high vapor pressure ratio of liquid hydrogen and liquid deuterium at a certain temperature, deuterium is fractionated from liquid hydrogen with a certain separation efficiency. Use a conveyor belt to introduce hydrogen from one side, after fractional distillation, export from the other side, and export the deuterium from the front port.","powerUsed":720,"idlePower":18,"input":1,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Fractionator\/name\/Fractionator"},"Miniature_Particle_Collider":{"className":"Miniature_Particle_Collider","name":"Miniature Particle Collider","category":"production","description":"When the two beams of particles are continuously accelerated to a certain intensity and energy, they will collide, and new particles can be obtained. It is usually used to stably produce deuterium and antimatter, but will consume a lot of energy.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/hadron-collider.png?v=1612258642","powerUsed":12000,"idlePower":120,"input":0,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Miniature_Particle_Collider\/name\/Miniature+Particle+Collider"},"Refinery":{"className":"Refinery","name":"Oil Refinery","category":"production","description":"The extracted crude oil is further refined to obtain refined oil and hydrogen.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/oil-refinery.png?v=1612259359","powerUsed":960,"idlePower":24,"input":0,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Refinery\/name\/Oil+Refinery"},"Matrix_Lab":{"className":"Matrix_Lab","name":"Matrix Lab","category":"production","description":"Connector to the CenterBrain. Used to both produce matrices and research technologies. The more matrix labs, the faster production or research speed can progress.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/lab.png?v=1612258663","powerUsed":480,"idlePower":12,"input":0,"output":1,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Matrix_Lab\/name\/Matrix+Lab"},"Wind_Turbine":{"category":"generator","className":"Wind_Turbine","name":"Wind Turbine","description":"The primary power facility. Can convert wind energy into electrical energy. The actual generation capacity is related to the planet's wind energy ratio.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/wind-turbine.png?v=1612257637","powerGenerated":300,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Wind_Turbine\/name\/Wind+Turbine"},"Solar_Panel":{"category":"generator","className":"Solar_Panel","name":"Solar Panel","description":"Directly generate electricity using sunlight, and the actual generation capacity is related to the planet's solar energy ratio. Not working at night, use accumulators can store excess energy during the day.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/solar-panel.png?v=1612261320","powerGenerated":360,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Solar_Panel\/name\/Solar+Panel"},"Thermal_Power_Station":{"category":"generator","className":"Thermal_Power_Station","name":"Thermal Power Plant","description":"Facility that use combustible materials (such as coal) as fuel to generate electrical energy. Energy loss between the energy value of the provided fuel and the produced electricity is expected.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/fuel-plant.png?v=1612259486","powerGenerated":2160,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Thermal_Power_Station\/name\/Thermal+Power+Plant"},"Ray_Receiver":{"category":"generator","className":"Ray_Receiver","name":"Ray Receiver","description":"Receives high-energy rays transmitted from the Dyson swarm or Dyson sphere. The received energy can be directly outputted to the power grid or stored as photons in a critical state.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/ray-receiver.png?v=1612259572","powerGenerated":6000,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Ray_Receiver\/name\/Ray+Receiver"},"Mini_Fusion_Power_Station":{"category":"generator","className":"Mini_Fusion_Power_Station","name":"Mini Fusion Power Plant","description":"Under the action of a high-strength, high-density magnetic field, a facility that converts the huge energy released by the controlled fusion reaction of deuterons into electrical energy.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/fusion-power-station.png?v=1612259199","powerGenerated":15000,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Mini_Fusion_Power_Station\/name\/Mini+Fusion+Power+Plant"},"Artificial_Star":{"category":"generator","className":"Artificial_Star","name":"Artificial star","description":"\"All you have to do is let the positive and negative proton beams quietly cross the magnetic field from both ends into the constraint sphere, nice'n easy!\" This scaled-down version of the system is known as the Mini-sun.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/fusion-reactor.png?v=1612259401","powerGenerated":72000,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Artificial_Star\/name\/Artificial+star"},"StorageMk1":{"className":"StorageMk1","name":"Storage Mk.I","category":"storage","description":"Used to store products, but the capacity is limited.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/storage-1.png?v=1612258583","maxSlot":30,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/StorageMk1\/name\/Storage+Mk.I"},"StorageMk2":{"category":"storage","name":"Storage Mk.II","className":"StorageMk2","description":"Has twice the capacity of Storage Mk.I and requires steel to produce.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/storage-2.png?v=1612259247","maxSlot":60,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/StorageMk2\/name\/Storage+Mk.II"},"StorageTank":{"category":"storage","className":"StorageTank","name":"Storage tank","description":"The Storage Tank has a larger capacity than the Storage for storing fluid. When dismantling a non-empty Storage Tank any remaining fluid will be lost.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/storage-tank.png?v=1612258235","maxFluid":10000,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/StorageTank\/name\/Storage+tank"},"Accumulator":{"category":"storage","className":"Accumulator","name":"Accumulator","description":"Power storage facility. When the electricity of the power grid is surplus, it will automatically store the excess power. When the power supply is insufficient, it will automatically discharge to maintain the operation of the facilities.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/accumulator.png?v=1612258483","powerUsed":900,"powerGenerated":900,"energy":270,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Accumulator\/name\/Accumulator"},"Accumulator_Full":{"category":"storage","className":"Accumulator_Full","name":"Accumulator (Full)","description":"The accumulator in the fully charged state. When the power is insufficient, can be constructed as a facility to automatically discharge, or it can be placed in an energy exchanger to release electrical energy.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/accumulator-full.png?v=1612259448","powerUsed":900,"powerGenerated":900,"energy":270,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Accumulator_Full\/name\/Accumulator+%28Full%29"},"ConveyorBeltMk1":{"className":"ConveyorBeltMk1","name":"Conveyor Belt Mk.I","category":"logistic","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/belt-1.png?v=1612259307","description":"We need automation! Conveyor belts are the most basic part of production automation. They can transport cargo from one place to another.","beltSpeed":6,"url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/ConveyorBeltMk1\/name\/Conveyor+Belt+Mk.I"},"ConveyorBeltMk2":{"className":"ConveyorBeltMk2","name":"Conveyor Belt Mk.II","category":"logistic","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/belt-2.png?v=1612259928","description":"An upgraded conveyor belt, with higher speed and consequently higher throughput.","beltSpeed":12,"url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/ConveyorBeltMk2\/name\/Conveyor+Belt+Mk.II"},"ConveyorBeltMk3":{"className":"ConveyorBeltMk3","name":"Conveyor Belt Mk.III","category":"logistic","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/belt-3.png?v=1612259909","description":"Maximize the speed and throughput of transporting cargo.","beltSpeed":30,"url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/ConveyorBeltMk3\/name\/Conveyor+Belt+Mk.III"},"Splitter":{"className":"Splitter","name":"Splitter","category":"logistic","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/splitter-4dir.png?v=1612258350","description":"Used to distribute cargo to different conveyor belts, or balance multiple conveyor belts. Can set the filter and priority on any one port.","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Splitter\/name\/Splitter"},"Traffic_Monitor":{"className":"Traffic_Monitor","name":"Traffic Monitor","category":"logistic","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/traffic-monitor.png?v=1639126639","description":"The Traffic Monitor is built on the conveyor belt to monitor the real-time cargo flow rate at the corresponding location. Conditions can be set to trigger an alarm.","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Traffic_Monitor\/name\/Traffic+Monitor"},"SorterMk1":{"className":"SorterMk1","name":"Sorter Mk.I","category":"logistic","description":"Transport cargo from conveyor belts into facilities or between facilities, can install filter to filter the cargo.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/inserter-1.png?v=1612260871","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/SorterMk1\/name\/Sorter+Mk.I"},"SorterMk2":{"className":"SorterMk2","name":"Sorter Mk.II","category":"logistic","description":"Can sort cargo more quickly.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/inserter-2.png?v=1612261250","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/SorterMk2\/name\/Sorter+Mk.II"},"SorterMk3":{"className":"SorterMk3","name":"Sorter Mk.III","category":"logistic","description":"In order to maximize the speed of sorting cargo, we can upgrade technology to increase the number of cargo that can be transported by the sorter MK.III each time.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/inserter-3.png?v=1612261235","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/SorterMk3\/name\/Sorter+Mk.III"},"Tesla_Tower":{"className":"Tesla_Tower","name":"Tesla Tower","category":"powerTransmission","description":"The power transmission facility. Can extend the power supply range of the power grid with a certain connection length and supply area.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/tesla-coil.png?v=1612260064","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Tesla_Tower\/name\/Tesla+Tower"},"Wireless_Power_Tower":{"className":"Wireless_Power_Tower","name":"Wireless Power Tower","category":"powerTransmission","description":"Remote transmission facility. Can consume electricity from the power grid to charge the mecha.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/charging-pole.png?v=1612258702","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Wireless_Power_Tower\/name\/Wireless+Power+Tower"},"Energy_Exchanger":{"className":"Energy_Exchanger","name":"Energy Exchanger","category":"powerTransmission","description":"The power conversion facility. Can not only store the surplus electric energy in the power grid into an empty accumulator to make a full accumulator; it can also release the electric energy stored in the full accumulator.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/energy-exchanger.png?v=1612260294","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Energy_Exchanger\/name\/Energy+Exchanger"},"Satellite_Substation":{"className":"Satellite_Substation","name":"Satellite Substation","category":"powerTransmission","description":"Wide-area power distribution facility. Can provide longer power transmission distances and larger power supply area.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/orbital-substation.png?v=1612260931","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Satellite_Substation\/name\/Satellite+Substation"},"Planetary_Logistics_Station":{"className":"Planetary_Logistics_Station","name":"Planetary Logistics Station","category":"planetaryLogistic","description":"The hub of the planetary logistics system. Logistics drones will automatically transport cargo between stations when you set the corresponding items for supply and demand. \\n(Only enables delivery around its own planet.)","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/logistic-station.png?v=1612259617","idlePower":60,"url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Planetary_Logistics_Station\/name\/Planetary+Logistics+Station"},"Logistics_Drone":{"className":"Logistics_Drone","name":"Logistics Drone","category":"planetaryLogistic","description":"It can dynamically balance the supply and demand in the planetary logistics system, but it will only work for the logistics station it belongs to.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/logistic-drone.png?v=1612259504","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Logistics_Drone\/name\/Logistics+Drone"},"Interstellar_Logistic_Station":{"className":"Interstellar_Logistic_Station","name":"Interstellar Logistics Station","category":"interstellarLogistic","description":"The magnificent space elevator realizes more convenient transportation of materials between planets. It can connect factories on different planets to form a gigantic industrial empire.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/interstellar-logistic-station.png?v=1612258216","idlePower":60,"url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Interstellar_Logistic_Station\/name\/Interstellar+Logistics+Station"},"Logistic_Vessel":{"className":"Logistic_Vessel","name":"Logistics Vessel","category":"interstellarLogistic","description":"It can dynamically balance the supply and demand of cargo between planets, and consumes space warper can activate warp.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/logistic-vessel.png?v=1612259427","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Logistic_Vessel\/name\/Logistics+Vessel"},"Foundation":{"className":"Foundation","name":"Foundation","category":"foundation","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/terrain-tool.png?v=1612258384","description":"A surface leveling tool. Cannot use it to change the planetary landforms at will, can only level the surface to zero altitude. If you use the foundation for high ground, you will get soil pile; on the contrary, if you use the foundation for the ocean or low-lying area, you must consume soil pile. When laying the foundation, you can choose a kind of decoration, or without decoration, only level the surface.","url":"\/en\/structures\/detail\/id\/Foundation\/name\/Foundation"},"EM-Rail_Ejector":{"className":"EM-Rail_Ejector","name":"EM-Rail Ejector","category":"special","description":"Launch a large amount of solar sails into the orbit of the system's star to form a Dyson swarm.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/em-rail-ejector.png?v=1612259379","powerUsed":1800,"idlePower":60,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/EM-Rail_Ejector\/name\/EM-Rail+Ejector"},"Vertical_Launching_Silo":{"category":"special","className":"Vertical_Launching_Silo","name":"Vertical Launching Silo","description":"Launch a small carrier rocket loaded with Dyson sphere components onto the Dyson sphere orbit to form nodes and frames.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/vertical-launching-silo.png?v=1612259721","powerUsed":18000,"idlePower":60,"url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Vertical_Launching_Silo\/name\/Vertical+Launching+Silo"},"Small_Carrier_Rocket":{"category":"special","className":"Small_Carrier_Rocket","name":"Small Carrier Rocket","description":"The delivery vehicle of Dyson sphere components. If you want to speed up the construction, you need to send more rockets.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/rocket.png?v=1612259777","url":"\/en\/buildings\/detail\/id\/Small_Carrier_Rocket\/name\/Small+Carrier+Rocket"}},"itemsData":{"Iron_Ore":{"className":"Iron_Ore","name":"Iron Ore","category":"ore","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/iron-ore.png?v=1612258134","description":"Used to smelt iron ingots and magnets. Obtained by gathering iron vein.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Iron_Ore\/name\/Iron+Ore"},"Copper_Ore":{"className":"Copper_Ore","name":"Copper Ore","category":"ore","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/copper-ore.png?v=1612260333","description":"Smelted directly into copper ingots. Obtained by gathering copper vein.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Copper_Ore\/name\/Copper+Ore"},"Stone_Ore":{"className":"Stone_Ore","name":"Stone Ore","category":"ore","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/stone-ore.png?v=1612259127","description":"Common ore. It is a raw material which can be also obtained from rocks.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Stone_Ore\/name\/Stone+Ore"},"Coal_Ore":{"className":"Coal_Ore","name":"Coal Ore","category":"ore","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/coal-ore.png?v=1612260845","description":"The solid combustible mineral. It's gradually formed by plants through complex biochemical and physical, and chemical changes. It is raw material for smelting and chemical production as well as an energy source.","energy":2.7,"color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Coal_Ore\/name\/Coal+Ore"},"Silicon_Ore":{"className":"Silicon_Ore","name":"Silicon Ore","category":"ore","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/silicium-ore.png?v=1612260797","description":"Obtained by gathering from silicon veins. It is usually used to make high-purity silicon crystals.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Silicon_Ore\/name\/Silicon+Ore"},"Crystal_Rubber":{"className":"Crystal_Rubber","name":"Organic Crystal","category":"ore","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/crystal-rubber.png?v=1612259653","description":"A high-grade chemical product. Used to produce higher strength crystals with a crystal structure. It can also be directly gathered from rare organic crystal vein.","energy":1.8,"color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Crystal_Rubber\/name\/Organic+Crystal"},"Bamboo_Crystal":{"className":"Bamboo_Crystal","category":"ore","name":"Spiniform Stalagmite Crystal","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/bamboo-crystal.png?v=1612259005","description":"It will only be a rare occurrence on the living planet that once existed widely in the ocean with a depth of 100,000 meters. After the marine life on these planets die, and the corpse sinks to the bottom of the sea, it can directly mineralize with seawater under the deep sea high pressure. If there is a stable, smooth, slow, and hot ocean current at this time, spiniform stalagmite crystal may form under the blow of the ocean current.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Bamboo_Crystal\/name\/Spiniform+Stalagmite+Crystal"},"Kimberlite_Ore":{"className":"Kimberlite_Ore","category":"ore","name":"Kimberlite Ore","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/diamond-ore.png?v=1612258445","description":"Rare ore. Directly crystallized from Kimberlite magma under CO\u2082 rich conditions, and diamond can obtained by further smelting.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Kimberlite_Ore\/name\/Kimberlite+Ore"},"Fractal_Silica":{"className":"Fractal_Silica","category":"ore","name":"Fractal Silicon","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/fractal-silica.png?v=1612260890","description":"It is a rare natural silicon ore with a unique geometric fractal structure. After the single crystal grows to a certain size, the branches of smaller silicon crystals grow from the matrix. Crystal fractal is a natural purification mechanism. The more fractal algebra, the higher the purity. Among them, fractal silicon with more than six generations can directly be used as the raw material for making lattice silicon.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Fractal_Silica\/name\/Fractal+Silicon"},"Gas_Hydrate":{"className":"Gas_Hydrate","category":"ore","name":"Fire Ice","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/gas-hydrate.png?v=1612259890","description":"Rare ore. Has cage-like microstructure which is similar to ice-like white solid, and covalent bonds in a critical state allow it to be used to produce graphene more efficiently.","energy":4.8,"color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Gas_Hydrate\/name\/Fire+Ice"},"Grating_Ore":{"className":"Grating_Ore","category":"ore","name":"Optical Grating Crystal","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/grating-ore.png?v=1612258426","description":"Rare ore. With naturally formed grooves distributed on the surface, is used to produce precision optical components and high-power exciters.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Grating_Ore\/name\/Optical+Grating+Crystal"},"Mono_Mag_Ore":{"className":"Mono_Mag_Ore","category":"ore","name":"Unipolar Magnet","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/mono-mag-ore.png?v=1612260975","description":"Rare ore. Has a pyrochlore lattice. After applying a magnetic field, we can affect the string's symmetry and direction, reduce the string network's density, and separating magnetic monopoles.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Mono_Mag_Ore\/name\/Unipolar+Magnet"},"Titanium_Ore":{"className":"Titanium_Ore","category":"ore","name":"Titanium Ore","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/titanium-ore.png?v=1612260545","description":"Can form under the action of high-intensity heat with a  particular molecular structure.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Titanium_Ore\/name\/Titanium+Ore"},"Oil":{"className":"Oil","category":"liquid","name":"Crude Oil","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/oil.png?v=1612258464","description":"Fossil formed by marine organisms can gather as a liquid mineral deposit. It contains the chemical energy marine organisms accumulated during their lifetime. Can as fuel or chemical raw material.","energy":4.05,"color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Oil\/name\/Crude+Oil"},"Refined_Oil":{"className":"Refined_Oil","category":"liquid","name":"Refined Oil","description":"The primary product of crude oil refining. A chemical fuel, can be used to produce various chemical products.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/refined-oil.png?v=1612259687","energy":4.5,"color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Refined_Oil\/name\/Refined+Oil"},"Water":{"className":"Water","category":"liquid","name":"Water","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/water.png?v=1612357989","description":"It can be obtained from a water pump and widely used in chemical production.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Water\/name\/Water"},"Sulphuric_Acid":{"className":"Sulphuric_Acid","category":"liquid","name":"Sulfuric Acid","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/sulphuric-acid.png?v=1612259670","description":"Primary chemical product. Produced from crude oil, can also be directly gathered from the sea of sulfuric acid with a water pump.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Sulphuric_Acid\/name\/Sulfuric+Acid"},"Iron_Ingot":{"className":"Iron_Ingot","name":"Iron Ingot","category":"material","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/iron-plate.png?v=1612260779","description":"Basic raw material. Used to produce various iron components.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Iron_Ingot\/name\/Iron+Ingot"},"Magnet":{"className":"Magnet","name":"Magnet","category":"material","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/magnet.png?v=1612261337","description":"Basic magnetic material. Obtained by smelting iron ore directly.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Magnet\/name\/Magnet"},"Magnetic_Coil":{"className":"Magnetic_Coil","name":"Magnetic Coil","category":"material","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/magnetism-wire.png?v=1612261183","description":"The most basic electromagnetic component. It is very functional.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Magnetic_Coil\/name\/Magnetic+Coil"},"Copper_Ingot":{"className":"Copper_Ingot","name":"Copper Ingot","category":"material","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/copper-plate.png?v=1612260125","description":"Basic raw material. Used to produce various copper components.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Copper_Ingot\/name\/Copper+Ingot"},"Stone":{"className":"Stone","name":"Stone Brick","category":"material","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/stone-brick.png?v=1612261164","description":"A common material. Obtained from smelting stone ores, is usually used as a foundation for facilities.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Stone\/name\/Stone+Brick"},"Glass":{"className":"Glass","name":"Glass","category":"material","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/glass.png?v=1612260312","description":"An amorphous optical m