uterium","category":"material","name":"Deuterium","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/deuterium.png?v=1612260105","description":"A stable isotope of hydrogen. Rarely exists under natural conditions. Most of them come from the reprocessing of hydrogen and the collection from the Gas giant.","energy":9,"color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Deuterium\/name\/Deuterium"},"Critical_Photon":{"category":"material","className":"Critical_Photon","name":"Critical Photon","description":"A critical state photon. Can be converted into antimatter and hydrogen under the action of a super magnetic field.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/photon-capacitor-full.png?v=1612259964","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Critical_Photon\/name\/Critical+Photon"},"Anti_Matter":{"category":"material","className":"Anti_Matter","name":"Antimatter","description":"It is obtained by inverting photons in a critical state. When the positive and antimatter meet, they will annihilate each other and generate huge energy.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/anti-matter.png?v=1612258976","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Anti_Matter\/name\/Antimatter"},"Strange_Matter":{"category":"material","className":"Strange_Matter","name":"Strange Matter","description":"Strange matter has a great gravitational negative pressure, which exceeds its energy density, so that the space around the strange matter is warped and meets the negative energy demand of the warp engine.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/strange-matter-generator.png?v=1612259753","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Strange_Matter\/name\/Strange+Matter"},"Frame_Material":{"className":"Frame_Material","name":"Frame Material","category":"material","description":"A new type of high-strength lightweight structure. Can withstand the strong gravitational force of stars compared with traditional structural materials, and is very suitable for manufacturing Dyson sphere components.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/frame-material.png?v=1612259467","color"