sma generated by the high-power exciter can be used to extract and refine crude oil, and can also be used to make wireless power tower for remote power transmission and charge mecha.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Plasma_Exciter\/name\/Plasma+Exciter"},"Photon_Combiner":{"className":"Photon_Combiner","name":"Photon Combiner","category":"component","description":"The surface of the prism is cut into nano-gratings and then reassembled. After continuously absorbing multiple low-energy photons will emit a high-energy photon under a combination of specific structures. The magic is that the natural Optical grating crystal in the cluster can directly do this.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/photo-shifter.png?v=1612258552","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Photon_Combiner\/name\/Photon+Combiner"},"Electric_Motor":{"className":"Electric_Motor","name":"Electric Motor","category":"component","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/electric-motor.png?v=1612261265","description":"The fundamental power system component. It can accelerate mechanical operation.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Electric_Motor\/name\/Electric+Motor"},"Electromagnetic_Turbine":{"className":"Electromagnetic_Turbine","name":"Electromagnetic Turbine","category":"component","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/mag-turbine.png?v=1612258114","description":"Make objects levitate against gravity, usually used to make more advanced magnetic field generators.","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Electromagnetic_Turbine\/name\/Electromagnetic+Turbine"},"Processor":{"className":"Processor","name":"Processor","category":"component","description":"Large-scale integrated circuit device. The application of semiconductor materials make it better in processing data and controlling the processing process.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/processor.png?v=1612258898","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Processor\/name\/Processor"},"Plane_Filter":{"className":"Plane_Filter","name":"Plane Filter","category":"component","description":"Studying the Rabi oscillation to obtain the law of the probability change with time during the evolution of the particle wave function over time, it can be artificially interfered with during the quantum transition so that the quantum jumps in the expected direction.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/plane-filter.png?v=1612259524","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Plane_Filter\/name\/Plane+Filter"},"Particle_Container":{"category":"component","className":"Particle_Container","name":"Particle Container","description":"While firmly binding the particles, it can guide particles to show some specific properties.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/partical-capacitor.png?v=1612258680","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Particle_Container\/name\/Particle+Container"},"Super-magnetic_Ring":{"category":"component","className":"Super-magnetic_Ring","name":"Super-Magnetic Ring","description":"Super magnetic field generating device. Generated super-strong magnetic field can directly act on the atomic scale, causing the distortion of the material lattice, thereby preparing high-performance materials and devices.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/hyper-magnetism-ring.png?v=1612259544","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Super-magnetic_Ring\/name\/Super-Magnetic+Ring"},"Graviton_Lens":{"category":"component","className":"Graviton_Lens","name":"Graviton Lens","description":"A piece of neutron star material that has been encapsulated after processing, its twisted and powerful gravitational field is shielded in a container. Usually, we will use it to process and change the spatial structure, but we can expect some one use it to refract the sunlight and ignite fire.","image":"\/img\/gameUI\/gravity-lens.png?v=1612260041","color":"#cbcdcd","url":"\/en\/items\/detail\/id\/Graviton_Lens\/name\/Graviton+Lens"},"Particle_Broadband":{"className":"Particle_Broadband","name":"Particle Broadband","category":"component","descripti